:feats/:defensive_awareness/:bonus_for = #set[]
:feats/:defensive_awareness/:bonus_for_except = #set[]
:feats/:defensive_awareness/:description = "There are three versions of this feat with cumulative benefits.\n(1): The character retains his dexterity bonus to AC, even if caught flat-footed or attacked by a hidden or invisible creature.\n(2): The character can no longer be flanked, since he can react to opponents on opposite sides of him as easily as he can react to a single attack.\n(3): The character gains an intuitive sense that alerts him to danger from traps, giving a +1 bonus to reflex saves made to avoid traps."
