:feats/:terrifying_rage/:bonus_for = #set[:barbarian]
:feats/:terrifying_rage/:bonus_for_except = #set[]
:feats/:terrifying_rage/:description = "While the barbarian is raging, any enemy (with less than the barbarian's hit dice) that comes close to him must make a will save opposed by the barbarian's intimidate check or become panicked for 1d3 rounds. Opponents with up to twice the barbarian's hit dice will not flee but will receive a -2 penalty to attack and saving throw rolls. Creatures with at least twice the barbarian's hit dice are not affected by the rage."
