:feats/:weapon_proficiency_simple/:use = "All characters except for [[druid]]s, [[monk]]s, [[rogue]]s, and [[wizard]]s are automatically proficient with all simple weapons. <del>The spell ''Tenser's transformation'' gives a wizard a temporary proficiency with all simple weapons.</del>"
